B --> C[Agent 2<br/>Strategy Generator]

C --> D[Agent 3<br/>Logical Evaluation]

D --> E[Agent 4<br/>Chart Analysis]

E --> F[Agent 5<br/>Sentiment Analysis]

F --> G[Agent 6<br/>LogiTrade Decision Coordinator]

G --> H[Risk Validation]

H --> I{Trade Approved?}

I -->|Yes| J[Execution Workflow]

I -->|No| K[Reject / Monitor]

J --> L[Position Monitoring]

L --> M[Outcome Analysis]

M --> G